WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:04.810
Dream...

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.430
I'm looking at a dream...

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:11.020
A dream I see everyday...

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.670
An endless... dream...

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.660
He remembers...?

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:19.310
He remembers...?

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.850
He remembers...?

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.020
It's alright...

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:25.770
He'll remember...

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.390
The day the dream didn't end...

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.220
When was it...?

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:36.960
A long time ago...?

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.080
Or just a few minutes ago...?

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.710
The answer to it...

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.850
misty in the dream...

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.610
In the time that you don't realize that if it's passing...

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.000
you just only wait...

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:06.180
Snow...?

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.270
It came again...

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:11.910
The season... of snow...

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.230
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

