00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:04.090
I'm taking a trip to eternity
eien no tabi wo shiteru

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:18.300
I continued the search on the cold tip of the finger
tsumetai yubisaki sagashi tsuzuketeta

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:23.670
It's burning from the fragments
kakera kara yaiteru

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:30.130
Hugging deep in my heart
tsuyoku mune ni dakishimete

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:37.210
The lost item that I was searching for
sagashiteita nakushimono

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:42.680
Checking for it in both of my hands
ryoute no naka tashikamete

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:56.060
The time that meets the new morning
atarashii asa ni deau toki ga ugakidasuyo

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:21.790
She's late...

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.800
The snow, it's piled up...

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.000
That's because I waited for two hours.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.700
Oh!  That's a surprise!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:45.650
I thought it was still two o'clock.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.800
Even if you thought it was two o'clock, you're still one hour late.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.620
Here, I'll give this to you.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.200
Oh!  Wha, hot hot hot.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:53.790
It's an apology for being late, and...
Oh!  Wha, hot hot hot.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.660
It's an apology for being late, and...

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.030
...a celebration of our reunion.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.310
Is this seven years reunion only worth one can of coffee?

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.220
I see... seven years have passed.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.860
Hey, do you remember my name?

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.780
You keep saying that, do you remember my name?

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.120
Yeah!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.790
Yuuichi.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:24.650
Okay... let's go now.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:27.670
Hey.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.130
My name!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:35.970
Let's go.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:36.980
Nayuki.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.010
Yeah!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:45.200
<b>Girl of Snow</b>

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:49.220
Nayuki!  Still more to go?

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.000
Just a bit.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:55.280
You said that earlier, but we've been walking for 30 minutes.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:05:00.340
Look over here.  The park where we picked up a cat together.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.470
Huh?  A cat?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.510
We had a snowball fight.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.130
I don't... remember that...

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:10.870
Should I carry your bag?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.830
Nope, it's fine.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:15.600
I can't have a girl carry a bag.

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:16.970
It's alright.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:18.300
I'm training.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:21.830
It's true.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.130
Even though I look like this, I'm in the track and field club.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.090
What?  Track and field?  Nayuki?

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:28.860
Why do you look so surprised?

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:30.970
I don't look like it, but I'm the captain of the team.

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:33.450
The other members are snails and tortoises?

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:36.230
They're all regular people.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:39.400
What?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.160
That's mean.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.700
Sorry.

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:50.020
I'll carry it after all.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.090
Oh, wait.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.420
Yuuichi!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.410
Yuuichiii!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:58.960
The northern town seven years ago...

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:05.680
When I was a kid, I came here many times to come visit my cousin Nayuki who lives here.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:12.170
I don't know why, but I don't come here anymore and we don't contact each other.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:16.190
When I had noticed, time had passed...

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.270
Mom, I'm home.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.070
Welcome back.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:22.620
Good afternoon.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.260
Welcome, Yuuichi-san.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.830
Wasn't it cold out there?

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.250
Please come in.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:38.210
The reason I came back to this town so suddenly was because my parents had been transferred overseas for business reasons.

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:45.120
I remained here, so I was forced to stay at my cousin Nayuki's house.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.670
But isn't it a foreign country?

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.070
Didn't you think of going with them?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.880
I can't even speak English properly and I would have had to speak Swahili.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:58.750
Yuuichi's father got transferred to a great place.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.600
If anything happens, tell me anytime without hesitating.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.150
From today, Yuuichi-san is a member of this household.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.410
Thank you for the kindness.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.710
I thought that Nayuki and Akiko-san were both good people.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:16.980
But to tell the truth, I didn't want to come back to this town...

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:21.960
Strangely, I can't remember the time I came seven years ago.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:25.940
And I find it difficult to fill in the blanks.

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.350
Why do I have this thing here...?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:41.940
Mom.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.040
That's enough crying.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.840
Well, I'll be going home now.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.410
Wait!

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:54.610
I'll come again.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:59.110
I'll wait tomorrow as well, at the same time, at the bench in front of the station.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:00.930
Promise...?

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.380
Yeah, it's a promise...

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.700
Ahh!  I'm still wearing my pajamas!

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:20.340
Mom!  Where is my uniform?

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.070
I don't have time...

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.870
I really don't have time.  What am I going to do?

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:33.600
It's cold!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.470
Now I know why it's so cold.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.420
Good morning, Yuuichi.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.470
Yeah...

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:02.670
Yuuichi, not "Yeah..." - You should say "Good morning" in the morning.

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:05.170
Good morning...

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.290
Sorry, did I wake you up?

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.650
It's still okay to sleep in for a while...

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:14.840
Nope, I can't sleep forever since I'm a freeloader in this house.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:14.910
Nayuki's Room
Nope, I can't sleep forever since I'm a freeloader in this house.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.240
Nayuki's Room

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.900
Yuuichi, you're still on winter break, so it's fine to sleep in.
Nayuki's Room

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.140
Nayuki's Room

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:20.610
You're going somewhere Nayuki?
Nayuki's Room

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:20.790
Nayuki's Room

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.310
I have club activities since I'm the captain.
Nayuki's Room

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:23.460
I have club activities since I'm the captain.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.950
Oh yeah, you said something like that.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:28.440
When will that finish?

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:34.330
Club activities?  We only have a meeting so I think I can be back by this afternoon.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:39.270
Then... Would it be alright to show me around town after you come back?

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.270
Yeah!  I'm fine with it.  Any time is good.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:43.850
Sorry.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:48.680
That's okay, since you'll be staying in this town forever.

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:51.100
I don't know if I'll stay forever...

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:59.340
I don't know when my parents will be coming back, and I also can't be a freeloader forever.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.270
Yeah, you're right...

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.030
By the way, aren't you late?

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:08.180
Ah, if I can run the 100 meter in seven seconds, I can be on time.

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:10.480
That's a world record.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.080
You think so...?

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.490
Good morning, Yuuichi-san.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.880
Good morning.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:18.730
Yuuichi-san, you're going to eat breakfast, right?

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:19.800
Yes, thanks.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.830
How about mine?

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.540
It would have been there if you woke up earlier.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:23.740
I'm so hungry...

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.210
But you won't be on time.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:27.420
Be careful when you go!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.120
Yeah!

00:10:28.130 --> 00:10:31.390
If she'd wake up earlier, it would help me a lot.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.020
Is Nayuki not a morning person?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.710
Starting tomorrow, Yuuichi-san will have a hard time.

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:40.100
Ah, oh right, Akiko-san...

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.090
Yes?

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.680
It doesn't seem to be Nayuki's.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.940
Ah, I see...

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:51.940
It's not Yuuichi-san's?

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:54.980
Don't just simply say something absurd like that.

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.470
It's strange...

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:02.010
If this isn't Nayuki's, did I bring this from home?

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:06.250
Isn't it mysterious that I put this in a box but I don't remember bringing it?

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:07.320
It is.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.870
Yuuichi-san, I'm going shopping for lunch, do you want anything?

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.610
Oh, I'll go instead.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:16.270
Eh?

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:20.240
It's alright, since I have time, and I think Nayuki is coming back soon,

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.640
so I'll go shopping when I pick her up.

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.120
But...

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.480
Aaaaah!  Forget shopping!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.370
But I can't leave it like that...

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:53.210
Hey, we have to go shopping before the sun goes down.

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.360
Yuuichi, you said that you would go with me.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:58.660
It's cold so I don't want to.

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.000
Lying is not good.

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:03.000
Or I'll make you swallow a thousand needles.

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.520
I don't want to do that either.

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.150
Then let's go.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:08.670
Don't worry, I don't think it's cold.

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.150
It must be a lie!

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.880
I get the point... let's go!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:15.140
I don't want to!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:16.920
Oh yeah...

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.130
Even then, I was whining...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.020
Just as I thought, it's cold!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.190
I don't think so.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.540
Today is sunny, so it's warm.

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:32.540
I got deceived by Nayuki.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.820
I didn't deceive anyone!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.430
It's really not cold.

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:37.430
This is a thousand needles to Nayuki.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.340
And since it's a campaign period, it's a tatami needle.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.790
I can't swallow that big a needle!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.840
Guts!  You swallow it with guts!

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:45.940
That's impossible...

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.280
Then I won't go.

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:48.510
Fine...

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:51.430
Then Yuuichi's dinner today will only be red pickled ginger!

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:55.410
You're going to eat a bowl full of red pickled ginger with more red pickled ginger!

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.020
The drink will be a juice of red pickled ginger!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:00.210
I got it...

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:01.670
I'll go, okay?

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.260
Come on, come on.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.930
Shops won't run away even if you hurry.

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:08.690
They won't run away but they'll close.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:09.690
That's right...

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:14.420
I went with Nayuki to go shopping for our dinner, and...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:21.950
Wait here.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.210
I'm going to be angry if you go home first.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:25.380
Don't worry.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.160
It's a promise.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:35.840
Yuuichi.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.880
Yuuichi, what's the matter?

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.030
I came to pick you up.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.580
Eh?  Really?

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.790
That was a lie.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.440
I'm buying things for lunch.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.190
Akiko-san told me to buy whatever I want.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.520
That's too bad, I was happy to see you.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.540
Well then, I'll leave everything to you!

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:58.720
I'm not a local here, so I don't know what's delicious.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.090
Yeah!  Leave it to me!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.030
Then I'll wait here.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.510
I don't want you leaving first.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.050
Sure...

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.910
This is the same... as that time...

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:14.810
Hey you!!!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.760
Move, move, move!!!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.010
Move, move, move, move!!!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:44.840
Ugh... that hurt...

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.680
I'm the one who's hurting!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:51.500
That's mean, I told you to move!

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:54.420
It isn't mean to run into other people?

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:57.320
I tried to stop but I couldn't!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.570
That's because you were running on a snowy road!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:00.820
Ughuu...

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.380
Here, can you stand up?

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:08.780
F-First of all, I'll tell you later!

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.050
Run!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.530
Ahhh! He, Hey wait!!!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:13.390
Hey!

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.400
I can't waiiiiit!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.020
What in the world is going on?

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.430
I'm being chased.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.060
By whom?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.760
I can't say anything beyond that.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.560
It's because I don't want to involve anyone else.

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:33.400
You've already involved me!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:33.830
Ahhh!  Sorry!  We'll talk later!
You've already involved me!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:35.440
Ahhh!  Sorry!  We'll talk later!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.770
Hey wait!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.250
Now what?

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:44.670
Just hide for now!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:45.960
Huh?

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.640
Him?  He's the one chasing you?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.780
That's right.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.580
He looks like a good natured guy to me.

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:02.990
You can't just judge by their appearance!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:11.470
Ah, that was scary...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.460
But that guy, why was he wearing an apron?

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:17.560
I think he's a Taiyaki shop owner.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:18.720
Huh!?

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.540
Why is a Taiyaki shop owner chasing you?

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:26.610
And also, what's in that paper bag you're holding so preciously in your hands?

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:27.870
This is...

00:16:28.270 --> 00:16:30.420
That was my favorite Taiyaki shop.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:34.110
The part where I ordered a lot was fine, but...

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:38.640
When I tried to pay him the money, I didn't have any, so...

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.380
I ran to escape from him!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:47.340
Isn't that because... you're the one who's in the wrong?

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:50.540
Ughuu... I can't help it!

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:52.080
Why can't it be helped!?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.150
If I tell you, it would be a very long story...

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:54.360
Yeah.
If I tell you, it would be a very long story...

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:54.770
Yeah.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.650
It's a story that is sooo complicated.

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:57.810
Don't worry, I have lots of time.
It's a story that is sooo complicated.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.960
Don't worry, I have lots of time.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.360
To tell the truth...

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.210
"To tell the truth..."?

00:17:03.490 --> 00:17:06.000
I was so hungry.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:07.810
Eh?  That's all?

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:08.660
Yeah!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.630
Exactly what I thought, you're the one who's in the wrong!

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:13.240
It's delicious.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.380
Don't eat.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:16.920
After all, taiyaki is best eaten when it's freshly baked.

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:17.420
That's something people who paid for it say.
After all, taiyaki is best eaten when it's freshly baked.

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:19.690
That's something people who paid for it say.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.430
Do you wanna eat some?

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:33.500
Listen, tell him the circumstances and apologize...

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.500
Ughuu...

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:35.580
No "Ughuu".

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:35.940
I'll pay for it later when I have the money.
No "Ughuu".

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:38.360
I'll pay for it later when I have the money.

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:41.700
That isn't the problem really...

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.690
I'm Ayu, Tsukimiya Ayu.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.010
I'm Yuuichi, Aizawa Yuuichi.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.190
Eh? Yuuichi-kun...

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.780
Hm?  What's wrong?

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.600
Nothing...  Nothing at all...

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:04.660
Yuuichi-kun!

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.330
I'll be going home now.

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.720
O-Oh...

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:08.850
Well, bye.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:11.130
It would be great if we see each other again.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.600
Great!?

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.650
Ughuu...  It'd be great!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:18.410
Yeah, I suppose.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.420
It would be good to see you again.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:20.640
Yeah!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:21.750
See you!

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.470
Ah!  Oh no!  Nayuki!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.830
Nayuki!  Nayuki!

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.180
Welcome back, Yuuichi-san.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.600
Did something happen?

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.930
Um... just a little...

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:51.340
Na...

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:53.790
Liar...

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.760
It's not good to be fighting.

00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.230
Nayuki...  I'm sorry...

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:02.900
It's okay...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.270
I was late yesterday, so it's even.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.400
Okay, then let's eat.

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.560
It's too late for lunch, but...

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.000
Yeah.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:21.550
"Ayu"...?

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:24.370
Geez, this was a fine day...

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:31.690
Yuuichi, the bath is free.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.330
Ah, oh yeah.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:36.910
Nayuki, I'm sorry, but can you lend me an alarm clock if you have any?

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.370
Yeah, it's okay.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:39.890
I have a lot.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:41.230
Wait a bit.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.860
Huh?  A lot?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.130
I'll let you borrow any one that you want.

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.970
Are you collecting them as a hobby?

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.630
It's not like that...

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:55.690
Yuuichi, which one do you want?

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.490
Ah, even if you say that...

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.850
Then...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.510
This one...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.950
Then can I borrow it for a while?

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:07.940
Yeah!  It's completely "Okay"!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.640
Thank you.

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:11.070
Yuuichi...

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.460
Hm?  What is it?

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.320
At night, it should be "Good night".

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.200
Yeah...  Good night.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:20.810
Good night.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.710
That's enough crying.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:33.710
I'm Aizawa Yuuichi.  What's your name?

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.150
Ayu...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.300
"Ayu"...?

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:42.370
What's your last name?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.080
A... yu...

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:45.500
Ayu Ayu?

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.650
It's not!

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.290
What's wrong?

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.280
Are you by any chance hungry?

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:54.660
I'm not!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:20:59.890
I knew it.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:04.490
Wait here.  I'll go buy something.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:05.900
Just stay there.

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.540
Here!

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:13.690
Taiyaki...

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:16.880
Taiyaki is best eaten when it's freshly baked.

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:21.890
It's salty...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.630
That's the taste of tears.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.450
But it's yummy...

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:27.760
Is it?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:29.630
Yeah!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.720
Well, I'll be going home now...

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:36.090
Wait!

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:39.280
What's wrong?

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:42.790
I want to eat taiyaki... again...

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:46.080
Do you like it so much?

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:51.140
Then should we eat it again sometime?

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:57.530
Then I'll wait tomorrow as well, at the same time, at the bench in front of the station.

00:21:58.620 --> 00:21:59.680
Promise...?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.430
Yeah... it's a promise.

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:05.830
Pinky swear.

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:08.630
I'll come even if I don't pinky swear.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:12.040
Ughuuuuu...  Pinky swear...!

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:14.980
I got it.

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.840
In the milky-white morning light,

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:26.490
I felt dazed...

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:30.300
A dream or a memory...

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:33.890
The answer to it, misty in those dreams...

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:35.680
Morning!

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:37.300
It's morning!

00:22:37.610 --> 00:22:41.690
Let's eat breakfast and go to school!

